<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong Oct air cargo traffic by country detailed.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong Oct air cargo traffic by country detailed.</headline>
<byline>Jim Gilchrist</byline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong Civil Aviation Department statistics show total air cargo handled in October by country rose 10.35 percent compared with the same month last year. Air cargo imports on both scheduled and non- scheduled flights reached 64,843.64 and 89,461.59 tonnes for exports.</p>
<p>The top 15 countries figures (rounded) are shown in tonnes in the table below in alphabetical order.</p>
<p>		     OCTOBER 1996 ALL CARGO</p>
<p>			Unloaded     Loaded	Pct change</p>
<p>							 from Oct 95</p>
<p> AUSTRALIA	  3,178.64     2,941.36    -4.08</p>
<p> CANADA	     1,851.36     1,951.16    13.94</p>
<p> CHINA MAINLAND   1,963.18     2,950.68    13.15</p>
<p> FRANCE	     2,214.39     2,167.83     6.74</p>
<p> GERMANY	    4,114.32     4,865.89     3.94</p>
<p> JAPAN		6,580.89    14,376.34    10.12</p>
<p> SOUTH KOREA	3,250.40     4,441.79     7.08</p>
<p> MALAYSIA	   1,909.95     1,803.46     5.55</p>
<p> NETHERLANDS	1,890,62     2,028.71    66.43</p>
<p> PHILIPPINES	2,611.37     2,516.16    64.02</p>
<p> SINGAPORE	  3,893.81     4,258.78     5.98</p>
<p> TAIWAN	    10,703.19    10,289.98    33.98</p>
<p> THAILAND	   4,567.28     3,132.42    10.66</p>
<p> UK		   3,905.32     4,621.35     4.63</p>
<p> USA		  5,088.38    19,254.36    -4.64</p>
<p>- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
